  "prefLabel": "He-P 4034.11 Quarterly Inventory",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4034.11 Quarterly Inventory.\n\n(a) Each licensee shall conduct a quarterly physical inventory to account for all sources of radiation and for all devices containing depleted uranium which have been received and possessed under the license.\n\n(b) The licensee shall maintain records of the quarterly inventory in accordance with He-P 4034.28.\n\nSource. #6942, eff 2-1-99; ss by #8800, INTERIM, eff 2-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-07\n\nNew. #8959, eff 8-7-07; ss by #10983, eff 11-24-15; amd by #12930, eff 11-26-19; ss by #14325, eff 7-19-25, EXPIRES: 7-19-35",
